    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nWelcome to St. John's Mill, Enniscorthy. \n\nNestled in one of Enniscorthy's most picturesque settings, St. John's Mill is an exceptional new residential development offering a stunning collection of beautifully designed 2, 3 and 4-bedroom homes. Perfectly positioned on the edge of town, this thoughtfully planned neighbourhood combines contemporary living with the beauty of the surrounding countryside.\n\nOverlooking the scenic River Slaney and surrounded by rolling landscapes, St. John's Mill offers residents a peaceful setting while remaining just minutes from every convenience. The development takes its name from the historic Old St. John's Mill, blending the area's rich heritage with modern architecture and energy-efficient design.\n\nDesigned for modern family living, each home features bright, spacious interiors, high-quality finishes and energy-efficient construction, creating homes that are as practical as they are stylish. Whether you're a first-time buyer, growing family or looking to downsize, St. John's Mill provides a home to suit every stage of life.\n\nLocated just minutes from Enniscorthy town centre, residents can enjoy excellent schools, shops, cafés, restaurants, sporting facilities and a host of local amenities. For commuters, the development is ideally situated only 8 minutes from access to the M11 motorway, providing convenient access to Wexford, Gorey, Dublin and beyond.\n\nAt St. John's Mill, you can enjoy the best of both worlds—a tranquil riverside setting with spectacular countryside views, all within easy reach of a thriving town. It's a place where modern living meets natural beauty, creating an outstanding place to call home.\n\nWhy You'll Love St. John's Mill\nBeautiful selection of 2, 3 & 4-bedroom homes\nStunning riverside setting overlooking the River Slaney\nEdge-of-town location surrounded by countryside\nSpacious contemporary layouts designed for modern living\nEnergy-efficient homes built to the highest standards\nJust minutes from schools, shops and local amenities\nOnly 8 minutes from the M11 motorway\nEasy commute to Wexford, Gorey and Dublin\n\nSt. John's Mill isn't just a new address—it's a lifestyle. A place where quality homes, breathtaking surroundings and exceptional convenience come together to create one of Enniscorthy's most desirable new developments."
      },
